WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:06.294
Staff qualifications and documents

00:00:06.344 --> 00:00:13.902
Open HR and Staff, then Documents. There are two tabs: Qualifications and Documents.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:22.299
On Qualifications, press Add Qualification and choose the staff member.

00:00:26.591 --> 00:00:32.169
Choose the type, then enter the qualification name, the institution and the year.

00:00:43.174 --> 00:00:47.683
Press Create. The qualification is added to the list.

00:00:50.391 --> 00:01:00.188
Open the Documents tab. It lists files such as contracts and ID cards. A yellow badge warns when a document is about to expire.

00:01:03.025 --> 00:01:12.298
To add one, press Add Document, choose the staff member and type, give a title and attach the file. The file is required.

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:16.519
Cancel for now.

00:01:19.418 --> 00:01:24.101
Records kept
